This directory is an unmodified copy of the `paypal_agent_toolkit.shared` package of release 1.11.0:
the PayPal REST client, the tool registry (method names, descriptions, argument schemas) and the
tool handlers for orders, invoices, subscriptions, disputes, shipment tracking and transaction
reporting. SEEN vendors it because the PyPI package pins agent frameworks (openai-agents, langchain,
crewai-tools) that this project does not use; the Sponsor Desk agent calls the toolkit's tools through
`paypal_agent_toolkit.shared.api.PayPalAPI` directly (see seen/money/paypal.py).
